.TH SDL_GetModState 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetModState \- Get the current key modifier state for the keyboard.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_keyboard.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_Keymod SDL_GetModState(void);
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns an OR\(aqd combination of the modifier keys for the keyboard\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

